1
00:00:00,098 --> 00:00:01,498
(Raj:)I bet you told Bernadette

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,270
all about he was screwing around
with Mandy Chao.

3
00:00:04,269 --> 00:00:05,569
(Leonard:)Oh, we didn't screw around.

4
00:00:05,571 --> 00:00:07,041
(Leonard:)We just got drunk and made out.

5
00:00:07,039 --> 00:00:09,809
(Raj:)Whatever. It would have
been nice to hear it from you.

6
00:00:23,455 --> 00:00:25,825
(Amy:)What are you doing here?

7
00:00:25,824 --> 00:00:28,254
(Sheldon:)I'm here to return
your belongings.

8
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:30,260
(Sheldon:)That's what people
who've broken up do.

9
00:00:30,262 --> 00:00:33,492
(Amy:)And you didn't do
your compulsive knocking ritual

10
00:00:33,498 --> 00:00:35,098
(Amy:)so I would open the door.

11
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,500
(Sheldon:)On the contrary,

12
00:00:36,501 --> 00:00:39,941
(Sheldon:)you no longer get to enjoy
my charming eccentricities.

13
00:00:41,273 --> 00:00:43,943
(Sheldon:)We're not friends with benefits.

14
00:00:45,177 --> 00:00:46,707
(Amy:)Just give me the box.

15
00:00:46,712 --> 00:00:48,582
W-Wait. Don't you want
to go through it

16
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,410
(Sheldon:)to make sure
I haven't forgotten anything?

17
00:00:50,415 --> 00:00:52,615
(Amy:)Fine.

18
00:00:53,785 --> 00:00:55,515
(Amy:)My old scarf.

19
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:58,090
(Sheldon:)You wore it the night
we went ice-skating. Remember?

20
00:00:58,090 --> 00:00:59,990
(Amy:)You mean the night
that I went ice-skating,

